OL,3,GNEWSADriver arrested after child
OL,4,Aseriously hurt in crash
OL,5,
OL,6,FA child has been taken to hospital with
OL,7,Fa serious head injury after a car crash
OL,8,Fin Birmingham, police said.
OL,10,FOfficers were called to Monyhull Hall
OL,11,FRoad, Kings Norton, shortly before
OL,12,F15:30 BST on Wednesday.
OL,14,FWest Midlands Police said the driver of
OL,15,Fthe car was arrested on suspicion of
OL,16,Fdrug driving.
OL,18,FOfficers have appealed for witnesses
OL,19,Fand anyone with dash-cam footage to
OL,20,Fcome forward.
